('B', '66339016-68a8-4fc0-b5fb-ee9ecfd13ac4', 'A7', 'Looking at the average rate of change from x=0 to x=2, I use the formula (f(2)-f(0))/(2-0) which gives me (0-4)/2 = -4/2 = -2.

